; META-EXEC (the bc0-3 / zealous shape, bounded): one exec matches a RULE whose head is
; a COMPOUND ((step $s)) and re-emits it as a new exec, which then runs. Exercises the
; coref DFS over a compound-headed higher-order factor plus exec self-visibility.
((step one) (, (a $x)) (, (b $x)))
(a 1)
(a 2)
(exec zealous (, ((step $s) $p $t)) (, (exec $s $p $t)))
